msgid ""
"sunnypilot learns to drive by watching humans, like you, drive.\n"
"\n"
"Firehose Mode allows you to maximize your training data uploads to improve openpilot's driving models. More data means bigger models, which means better Experimental Mode."
msgstr ""
"sunnypilot 通过观察人类驾驶来学习。\n"
"\n"
"Firehose 模式可最大化训练数据上传量以改进 openpilot 的驾驶模型。更多数据意味着更大的模型，进而带来更好的实验模式。"


msgid ""
"For maximum effectiveness, bring your device inside and connect to a good USB-C adapter and Wi-Fi weekly.\n"
"\n"
"Firehose Mode can also work while you're driving if connected to a hotspot or unlimited SIM card.\n"
"\n"
"Frequently Asked Questions\n"
"\n"
"Does it matter how or where I drive? Nope, just drive as you normally would.\n"
"\n"
"Do all of my segments get pulled in Firehose Mode? No, we selectively pull a subset of your segments.\n"
"\n"
"What's a good USB-C adapter? Any fast phone or laptop charger should be fine.\n"
"\n"
"Does it matter which software I run? Yes, only upstream openpilot (and particular forks) are able to be used for training."
msgstr ""
"为达到最佳效果，请每周将设备带入室内并连接优质 USB-C 适配器和 Wi-Fi。\n"
"\n"
"如果连接了热点或无限流量 SIM 卡，Firehose 模式也可在驾驶时使用。\n"
"\n"
"常见问题\n"
"\n"
"驾驶方式或地点有影响吗？没有，正常驾驶即可。\n"
"\n"
"Firehose 模式会拉取我的全部数据片段吗？不会，我们只选择性拉取一部分。\n"
"\n"
"推荐什么 USB-C 适配器？任意快充手机/笔记本充电器均可。\n"
"\n"
"使用的软件版本有影响吗？是的，仅上游 openpilot（及特定分支）可用于训练。"


msgid "When enabled, sunnypilot will attempt to manage the built-in cruise control buttons by emulating button presses for limited longitudinal control."
msgstr "启用后，sunnypilot 将尝试通过模拟按钮按压来管理内置巡航控制按钮，实现有限的纵向控制。"


msgid "ADB (Android Debug Bridge) allows connecting to your device over USB or over the network. See https://docs.comma.ai/how-to/connect-to-comma for more info."
msgstr "ADB（Android 调试桥）允许通过 USB 或网络连接您的设备。详见 https://docs.comma.ai/how-to/connect-to-comma。"


msgid "Warning: This grants SSH access to all public keys in your GitHub settings. Never enter a GitHub username other than your own. A comma employee will NEVER ask you to add their GitHub username."
msgstr "警告：这将授权您 GitHub 设置中所有公钥的 SSH 访问权限。切勿输入他人 GitHub 用户名。comma 员工绝不会要求您添加他们的 GitHub 用户名。"


msgid "sunnypilot is continuously calibrating, resetting is rarely required. Resetting calibration will restart sunnypilot if the car is powered on."
msgstr "sunnypilot 持续进行校准，很少需要重置。如果车辆已上电，重置校准将重启 sunnypilot。"


msgid "Use the sunnypilot system for adaptive cruise control and lane keep driver assistance. Your attention is required at all times to use this feature."
msgstr "使用 sunnypilot 系统进行自适应巡航控制和车道保持驾驶辅助。使用此功能需要全程保持注意力。"


msgid "Standard is recommended. In aggressive mode, sunnypilot will follow lead cars closer and be more aggressive with the gas and brake. In relaxed mode sunnypilot will stay further away from lead cars. On supported cars, you can cycle through these personalities with your steering wheel distance button."
msgstr "推荐使用标准模式。激进模式下，sunnypilot 将更近距离跟车且油门刹车更积极。从容模式下 sunnypilot 将保持更远跟车距离。支持的车型可通过方向盘跟车距离按钮切换驾驶风格。"


msgid "Receive alerts to steer back into the lane when your vehicle drifts over a detected lane line without a turn signal activated while driving over 31 mph (50 km/h)."
msgstr "当车速超过 31 mph（50 km/h）且未打转向灯时，若车辆偏离检测到的车道线，将收到返回车道的警报。"


msgid "sunnypilot defaults to driving in chill mode. Experimental mode enables alpha-level features that aren't ready for chill mode. Experimental features are listed below:<br><h4>End-to-End Longitudinal Control</h4><br>Let the driving model control the gas and brakes. sunnypilot will drive as it thinks a human would, including stopping for red lights and stop signs. Since the driving model decides the speed to drive, the set speed will only act as an upper bound. This is an alpha quality feature; mistakes should be expected.<br><h4>New Driving Visualization</h4><br>The driving visualization will transition to the road-facing wide-angle camera at low speeds to better show some turns. The Experimental mode logo will also be shown in the top right corner."
msgstr "sunnypilot 默认以 Chill 模式驾驶。实验模式启用尚未准备好用于 Chill 模式的 Alpha 级功能。实验功能如下：<br><h4>端到端纵向控制</h4><br>让驾驶模型控制油门和刹车。sunnypilot 将按照人类驾驶方式行驶，包括在红灯和停车标志处停车。由于驾驶模型决定行驶速度，设定速度仅作为上限。这是 Alpha 质量功能，可能会出现错误。<br><h4>新驾驶可视化</h4><br>低速时驾驶可视化将切换到朝前的广角摄像头，以更好地显示转弯。实验模式标志也将显示在右上角。"


msgid "An alpha version of sunnypilot longitudinal control can be tested, along with Experimental mode, on non-release branches."
msgstr "sunnypilot 纵向控制的 Alpha 版本可在非发布分支上随实验模式一起测试。"


msgid "Toggle visibility of advanced sunnypilot controls.<br>This only changes the visibility of the toggles; it does not change the actual enabled/disabled state."
msgstr "切换高级 sunnypilot 控件的可见性。<br>仅改变开关的可见性，不会改变实际的启用/禁用状态。"


msgid "copyparty is a very capable file server, you can use it to download your routes, view your logs and even make some edits on some files from your browser. Requires you to connect to your comma locally via its IP address."
msgstr "copyparty 是一款功能强大的文件服务器，可用于下载路线、查看日志，甚至通过浏览器编辑部分文件。需要通过 IP 地址本地连接到您的 comma 设备。"


msgid "When toggled on, this creates a prebuilt file to allow accelerated boot times. When toggled off, it removes the prebuilt file so compilation of locally edited cpp files can be made."
msgstr "开启后创建预构建文件以加速启动。关闭后删除预构建文件，以便编译本地修改的 cpp 文件。"


msgid "Apply a custom timeout for settings UI.<br>This is the time after which settings UI closes automatically if user is not interacting with the screen."
msgstr "设置 UI 的自定义超时时间。<br>用户不操作屏幕时设置界面自动关闭的时间。"


msgid "Enable this for the car to learn and adapt its steering response time. Disable to use a fixed steering response time. Keeping this on provides the stock openpilot experience."
msgstr "启用以让车辆学习并自适应转向响应时间。禁用则使用固定转向响应时间。保持开启可获得原版 openpilot 体验。"


msgid "If you're driving at 20 mph (32 km/h) or below and have your blinker on, the car will plan a turn in that direction at the nearest drivable path. This prevents situations (like at red lights) where the car might plan the wrong turn direction."
msgstr "当车速低于 20 mph（32 km/h）且开启转向灯时，车辆将在最近可行驶路径上规划转向。这可以防止车辆规划错误转向方向的情况（如在红灯处）。"


msgid "Enable the beloved MADS feature. Disable toggle to revert back to stock sunnypilot engagement/disengagement."
msgstr "启用备受喜爱的 MADS 功能。禁用开关可恢复原版 sunnypilot 的激活/脱离方式。"


msgid "Set a timer to delay the auto lane change operation when the blinker is used. No nudge on the steering wheel is required to auto lane change if a timer is set. Default is Nudge.<br>Please use caution when using this feature. Only use the blinker when traffic and road conditions permit."
msgstr "设置计时器以延迟打转向灯时的自动变道操作。设置计时器后无需轻推方向盘即可自动变道。默认为轻推模式。<br>使用此功能时请谨慎。仅在交通和道路条件允许时使用转向灯。"


msgid "Toggle to enable a delay timer for seamless lane changes when blind spot monitoring (BSM) detects a obstructing vehicle, ensuring safe maneuvering."
msgstr "启用以在盲区监测 (BSM) 检测到阻挡车辆时延迟变道，确保安全操控。"


msgid "Enables self-tune for Torque lateral control for platforms that do not use Torque lateral control by default."
msgstr "为默认不使用扭矩横向控制的平台启用自调校。"


msgid "Less strict settings when using Self-Tune. This allows torqued to be more forgiving when learning values."
msgstr "使用自调校时的宽松设置，使扭矩在学习数值时更加宽容。"


msgid "Enables custom tuning for Torque lateral control. Modifying Lateral Acceleration Factor and Friction below will override the offline values indicated in the YAML files within \"opendbc/car/torque_data\". The values will also be used live when \"Manual Real-Time Tuning\" toggle is enabled."
msgstr "启用扭矩横向控制的自定义调校。修改下方的横向加速度系数和摩擦力将覆盖 opendbc/car/torque_data 中 YAML 文件的离线值。启用\"手动实时调参\"开关时这些值也将实时生效。"


msgid "Enforces the torque lateral controller to use the fixed values instead of the learned values from Self-Tune. Enabling this toggle overrides Self-Tune values."
msgstr "强制扭矩横向控制器使用固定值而非自调校学习值。启用此开关将覆盖自调校值。"


msgid "Experimental feature to enable stop and go for Subaru Global models with manual handbrake. Models with electric parking brake should keep this disabled. Thanks to martinl for this implementation!"
msgstr "实验性功能：为手动驻车制动的 Subaru 全球车型启用启停功能。电子驻车制动的车型应保持禁用。感谢 martinl 的实现！"


msgid "sunnypilot will allow some Toyota/Lexus cars to auto resume during stop and go traffic. This feature is only applicable to certain models that are able to use longitudinal control. This is an alpha feature. Use at your own risk."
msgstr "sunnypilot 将允许部分 Toyota/Lexus 车辆在启停交通中自动恢复行驶。此功能仅适用于能够使用纵向控制的特定车型。这是 Alpha 功能，使用风险自负。"


msgid "Display useful metrics below the chevron that tracks the lead car only applicable to cars with sunnypilot longitudinal control."
msgstr "在跟踪前车的 V 形图标下方显示实用指标，仅适用于拥有 sunnypilot 纵向控制的车辆。"


msgid "Enabling this will display warnings when a vehicle is detected in your blind spot as long as your car has BSM supported."
msgstr "启用后，只要车辆支持盲区监测，将在检测到盲区有车辆时显示警告。"


msgid "A beautiful rainbow effect on the path the model wants to take. It does not affect driving in any way."
msgstr "在模型规划的路径上显示美丽的彩虹效果，完全不影响驾驶。"


msgid "Displays the name of the road the car is traveling on.<br>The OpenStreetMap database of the location must be downloaded from the OSM panel to fetch the road name."
msgstr "显示车辆当前行驶道路的名称。<br>需从 OSM 面板下载该位置的 OpenStreetMap 数据库以获取道路名称。"


msgid "A chime and on-screen alert will play when the traffic light you are waiting for turns green and you have no vehicle in front of you.<br>Note: This chime is only designed as a notification. It is the driver's responsibility to observe their environment and make decisions accordingly."
msgstr "当等待的红灯变绿且前方无车时，将播放提示音和屏幕提醒。<br>注意：此提示音仅作为通知。驾驶员有责任观察周围环境并做出相应决定。"


msgid "A chime and on-screen alert will play when you are stopped, and the vehicle in front of you start moving.<br>Note: This chime is only designed as a notification. It is the driver's responsibility to observe their environment and make decisions accordingly."
msgstr "当停车且前车开始移动时，将播放提示音和屏幕提醒。<br>注意：此提示音仅作为通知。驾驶员有责任观察周围环境并做出相应决定。"


msgid "Show an indicator on the left side of the screen to display real-time vehicle acceleration and deceleration. This displays what the car is currently doing, not what the planner is requesting."
msgstr "在屏幕左侧显示指示器，展示车辆实时加速和减速。显示的是车辆当前实际状态，而非规划器请求的状态。"

